@startuml
title Fluxo de Indisponibilidade de Médico (RabbitMQ)
autonumber

actor Admin as "Administrador"
participant DocCtrl as "PhysicianController\n(doctors-service)"
queue Rabbit as "RabbitMQ\n(Exchange: doctors-exchange)"
participant AppService as "AppointmentService\n(appointments-service)"
database AppDB as "PostgreSQL\n(Appointments)"

Note over Admin, DocCtrl: POST /physicians/unavailable\n{id: 2, from:..., to:...}

Admin -> DocCtrl: markPhysicianUnavailable(...)
activate DocCtrl

    note right of Admin: Requer Role: ADMIN

    DocCtrl -> DocCtrl: Criar PhysicianUnavailableEvent

    DocCtrl -> Rabbit: convertAndSend(routingKey, event)
    activate Rabbit
    note right: "Fire and Forget"

    Rabbit --> DocCtrl: Ack
    deactivate Rabbit

    DocCtrl --> Admin: 200 OK "Indisponibilidade enviada"
deactivate DocCtrl

par Processamento Assíncrono
    Rabbit -> AppService: Consome Evento (Queue Listener)
    activate AppService

    AppService -> AppDB: Buscar consultas no intervalo
    activate AppDB
    AppDB --> AppService: Lista de Consultas
    deactivate AppDB

    loop Para cada consulta conflituosa
        AppService -> AppDB: Atualizar Status (CANCELLED/RESCHEDULED)
        AppService -> AppService: Notificar Paciente (Opcional)
    end

    deactivate AppService
end
@enduml